{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T13:33:45.540Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1630","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1630","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1626+pm-gh1630+pm-gh1633","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1630","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1630","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T13:33:45.540Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Full-suite finding, fixed before close: the first full run (11,669 tests) caught a bootstrap regression introduced by this change. command-recovery imported read-output-contracts to read projection modes. That module transitively loads the TOON formatter, and commander-usage puts command-recovery on the boot path, so 'pm --version' from a dist copy without node_modules failed with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND @toon-format/toon (runtime-compatibility-boundary.spec.ts). The native surface table, legacy-flag tables, projection-mode derivation and native surface resolver moved verbatim into the dependency-free src/sdk/read-output/surfaces.ts. read-output-contracts imports them back, so its exports and contracts are unchanged (sdk surface 0 classified changes, contract snapshot current). command-recovery now imports only the light module. Verified that a no-deps dist copy prints 2026.10.28 and imports command-recovery and error-guidance without dependencies. The runtime-boundary spec now passes and is linked as this item's second test. The remaining full-suite failure, composed-continuation, is environmental on this host: Linuxbrew Node 26 cannot resolve npm/package.json. It fails identically on base d9c4a0bca and passes with NODE_PATH=$(npm root -g)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T13:33:45.540Z"}],"before_hash":"bfa33b6d117347d452a4c0bce6c5ddb86613fb6c788718411a75cf2d1463956c","after_hash":"3bc99ef4426432f19546fe783e04c104d8d928c3bf2ab8ce2217025fb55c1521","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b94e20955c0f61c694026c24d9dabde4112600d5a819e75b35837abdee8fb0e1"}
